a date and a time: Ok
no time of day, a text that matches: InvalidFormat(the fields of '%Y-%m-%d' do not make a time of day: no text read by it is a time.DateTime)
no time of day, a text that does not: InvalidFormat(the fields of '%Y-%m-%d' do not make a time of day: no text read by it is a time.DateTime)
no date: InvalidFormat(the fields of '%H:%M:%S' do not make a date: no text read by it is a time.DateTime)
a 12-hour clock without its half of the day: InvalidFormat(the fields of '%Y-%m-%d %I:%M' do not make a time of day: no text read by it is a time.DateTime)
the same with it: Ok
an empty pattern: InvalidFormat(the pattern is empty: no text read by it is a time.DateTime)
an empty pattern, a text: InvalidFormat(the pattern is empty: no text read by it is a time.DateTime)
an unknown specifier: InvalidFormat(invalid format specifier in '%Q')
a text that does not match: ParseFormat
a thirteenth month: OutOfRange
a date: Ok
a date: no day: InvalidFormat(the fields of '%m.%Y' do not make a date: no text read by it is a time.Date)
a date: only a time: InvalidFormat(a specifier of a time of day in '%H:%M' is not valid for a time.Date)
a date: an empty pattern: InvalidFormat(the pattern is empty: no text read by it is a time.Date)
a date: a text that does not match: ParseFormat
a date: the 30th of February: OutOfRange
